    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Mead refers to items which can be consumed for temporary health and stamina boosts, as well as preventing harmful status effects.\nMead must first be crafted into a mead base at a Mead ketill and then fermented using a Fermenter.\nMead can be consumed with or without a Tankard, Dvergr tankard or a Horn of Celebration."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Cooldown",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Meads have cooldown during which a player cannot drink another mead of the same type. Some meads share the same exclusion group:\n• Healing meads group: Minor healing mead Medium healing mead Major healing mead Lingering healing mead\n• Stamina meads group: Minor stamina mead Medium stamina mead Lingering stamina mead\n• Eitr meads group: Minor eitr mead Lingering eitr mead"
    },
